# Improvement plan A3: compare and report. Two bars made from the conduction starter, the second with twice the
# diffusivity (it warms faster), both run; Studies > Compare cases picks them; the histories of the middle's probe on one
# chart; the comparison's report, each case's report (Results > Export report); a line probe on a cube with reference data.
click nav:new case
wait 10
click starter-bar
wait-until page Overview
click nav:new case
wait 10
click starter-bar
wait-until page Overview
shell sed -i 's/^DT .*/DT              2e-4;/' $SB/ws/bar-conduction-2/constant/transportProperties
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
click run-go
wait-until job finished timeout 120
open $SB/ws/bar-conduction
click nav:run
wait-until page Run
click run-go
wait-until job finished timeout 120
wait 5
click nav:studies
wait-until page Studies
click st-compare
wait-until modal any timeout 5
click sc-name
key A ctrl
type bars
clickat sc-case#0 0.02 0.5
clickat sc-case#1 0.02 0.5
wait 2
screenshot $OUT/compare_modal.png
click sc-go
wait-until modal none timeout 5
wait 10
assert text A comparison of 2 cases
assert text over time, each case
screenshot $OUT/compare_histories.png
click st-report
wait 5
assert file $SB/ws/bars-report.md
assert log $SB/ws/bars-report.md | bar-conduction |
assert file $SB/ws/bars-report.svg
open $SB/ws/bar-conduction
click nav:results
wait-until page Results
wait 5
# scrolled from the tabs: the cross section's view takes wheel turns as zoom
wheel -80 res-tabs#0
click res-report
wait 5
assert file $SB/ws/bar-conduction/report/report.md
assert log $SB/ws/bar-conduction/report/report.md **Starter: Heat conduction in a bar.**
assert file $SB/ws/bar-conduction/report/residuals.svg
assert file $SB/ws/bar-conduction/report/monitor1.svg
screenshot $OUT/results_report.png
